NC Digital builds fast, modern, SEO-focused websites for small businesses across Wales — from Cardiff and Swansea in the south to Wrexham and Bangor in the north. If you need affordable web design in Wales without ending up with a slow template site, we can build a professional website that is clear, fast, and ready for local SEO.

> "A well-built website is your digital shopfront — it should be fast, clear, and designed to convert visitors into customers."

## Web design across Wales

Wales has a thriving small business economy — but most customers search online before they ever make contact. Whether you're in South Wales, [North Wales](/web-design-north-wales/), or [Mid Wales](/web-design-mid-wales/), your website is often the first thing a potential customer sees.

We build websites with local search built in, combining strong service pages, location signals, and technical SEO so Welsh businesses get found. Need your rankings to grow over time? Our [Wales SEO service](/seo-wales/) works hand-in-hand with your new website.

## Affordable web design for small businesses in Wales

Small business web design in Wales needs to do more than look tidy. It needs to explain what you do, show where you work, build trust quickly, and make it easy for customers to contact you. We keep the build focused on the pages and features that actually help your business win enquiries.

For many Welsh businesses, that means:

- A clear homepage with your services and service areas
- Dedicated pages for important towns or regions
- Mobile-first design for customers searching on their phones
- On-page SEO for Welsh location searches
- Fast hosting, SSL, and simple maintenance options

Our WordPress web design service starts from £199 for a one-page website. We also offer [managed starter websites across Wales](/managed-starter-websites-wales/) from £20/month inc. VAT for smaller businesses that want a managed monthly option.

## What's included in our web design packages

Every web design project across Wales includes:

- Custom website optimised for speed, clarity, and conversions
